#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:116
#: 78a59d63a47b4f7a96989a9971c83192
msgid "Each bit of the mask describes whether a motor is attached and should be used with oneWire. The value is configured decimal and is the sum of the decimal equivalent of each set bit. Bit 1 corresponds to 2^1 = 1, Bit 2 corresponds to 2^2 = 2,... . E.g. if you have connected Motor 1,2,3,4 the mask is 1+2+4+8 = 15."
